    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a home with a loan. So, if you hear\nasymmetric upside and think go all in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795760,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's how people blow up. The goal\nisn't to [music] win one big time. The"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799320,
    "dDurationMs": 5684,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "goal is to never lose the game. That\nbrings us to law number six. Don't bet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803160,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the empire for a pot of gold. My friend\n[music] bet his entire life savings on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806960,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one deal and lost everything. He and his\nwife had systematically saved a little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810880,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over $700,000 in life savings [music]\nand then they got introduced to an oil"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815240,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and natural gas deal. Every part of the\ndeal was extremely attractive. It had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819480,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tax advantages, it had great return\nprofile and his friend was actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824120,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "promoting the deal. It was almost a\nno-brainer. He took his entire life"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828360,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "savings, almost $700,000, and he\ninvested it in this deal. As you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832600,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "imagine, the deal did not go well. And 2\nyears later, the entire investment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837040,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "collapsed. Over 15 years of savings\ninstantly [music] vanished. There's a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840320,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lesson here to be learned. It's not\nabout evaluating the investment [music]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843840,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or evaluating the friend that brought it\nto them or evaluating what they should"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847000,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have done or not done differently. It's\nabout sizing the bet. You don't risk the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851080,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "empire for a pot of gold. You don't risk\n15-plus years of savings all on one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856120,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "deal. And [music] that is the sizing\ninvestment that we should learn today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859800,
    "dDurationMs": 7880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, if this was your entire empire,\nour job is to size our investments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863920,
    "dDurationMs": 7880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "correctly. We need to size our bets.\nAnd sizing bets is a very important part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870120,
    "dDurationMs": 5625,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of investing. The best lesson I learned\nabout sizing bets was to manage risk cuz"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874200,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the entire idea of doing this is to\n[music] manage risk. I learned this idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877360,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of managing risk from Ray Dalio and I\nwant to break it down for you. He talked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880280,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about risk\nand return."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882950,
    "dDurationMs": 4810,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e [music]\n\u003e\u003e Because every investment has some risk",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885839,
    "dDurationMs": 5681,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and every investment has a return. Let's\nsay you have an investment that has a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889080,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "risk of 150, [music] which is a random\nnumber, and it gave you a 15% return. Or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894839,
    "dDurationMs": 7601,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you had an investment that gave you a\nrisk of 100 and a 12% return."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899839,
    "dDurationMs": 7481,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, what Ray Dalio says is our job is\nto keep this return the same but reduce"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904960,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the risk. What if you could then get to\na risk of 80 but still get a 12% return?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910160,
    "dDurationMs": 7720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or get to a risk of 70 but still get to\na 12% return? Or get to a risk of 60 and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914920,
    "dDurationMs": 7560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe get to 11.5% of return. This\nbecomes the best [music] investment. Our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920000,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our is to figure out how we can reduce\nthe risk and keep the return exactly the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924560,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "same. The number one mistake that people\nmake is that they try to increase the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927800,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "return without paying [music] any\nattention to the risk. The best of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931280,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "best, the greatest of the greats, figure\nout how to reduce the risk while keeping"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935120,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the return exactly the same. There are\ntwo big learnings here. Number one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938440,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "protect the machine that produces the\nopportunities,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940590,
    "dDurationMs": 3850,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e [music]\n\u003e\u003e which is your empire. And number two,",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942600,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "swing for the upside when your downside\nis capped. And once you size the bets to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946520,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "survive, the next protection is really\nsimple. You diversify"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951120,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only where you don't know. Law number\nseven, diversification is a hedge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954680,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "against ignorance. Wall Street tells you\nto spread your money across everything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958400,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but every wealthy person I know does the\nexact opposite. Here's why. Because when"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963040,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you don't understand [music] something\nor you don't control something, then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966760,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're just hoping that it works out.\nHere's a formula for investing in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969960,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "companies and it has two vectors. Number\none, risk, and the second is control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973996,
    "dDurationMs": 5924,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[music] When you understand risk and you\nhave control, it tells you whether you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978120,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can concentrate or diversify. So, in\nthis case, when you understand risk and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981640,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have control, you get to put all\nyour eggs in one basket because you know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985160,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything about the business, which is\nyour [music] business. But what if you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988720,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "understand the risk but you don't have\ncontrol? It's [music] Apple or Google or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992760,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some other company. That means it's\nokay, but you still invest in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996040,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "business because you understand the\nrisk. If you don't understand the risk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999640,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you have control, you have ownership\ncontrol, then it just means you're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002880,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "missing a key operator. So, all you need\nto do is get a key operator [music] in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006200,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the business. But last but not least, if\nyou neither understand the risk nor you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009960,
    "dDurationMs": 5301,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have control, that's the time where you\nactually spread your bets out. That's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013920,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the time where you completely diversify.\n[music]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015800,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why most entrepreneurs and\ninvestors have their entire net worth in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019560,
    "dDurationMs": 7080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their business. Take Bill Gates or Elon\nMusk. If you remove their equity from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024240,
    "dDurationMs": 6599,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Microsoft and Tesla, they dramatically\ndrop in the Forbes 400 list. [music]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028439,
    "dDurationMs": 6801,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why operators like Elon Musk or\nJeff Bezos or Mark Zuckerberg understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033480,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the risk so deeply in their business\nthat they don't [music] diversify from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037280,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it. They own all their stock and all\ntheir equity because they have the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041040,
    "dDurationMs": 6039,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "insider information, they have the\ninsider plan, then they have the future"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044680,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "control and influence of the risk to\nbuild [music] and grow their business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1048439,
    "dDurationMs": 6201,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, knowing these laws isn't enough.\nYou have to know how to use them as a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052760,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "system to make you money. Here are the\nfive questions to ask before investing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056520,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in anything. Number one, can this\ncompound? [music]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059120,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meaning, is this a good long-term\ninvestment? Number two, who has control?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062960,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it you or someone else? Number three,\nwhat happens if it fails?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067007,
    "dDurationMs": 3313,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e [music]\n\u003e\u003e Do you get some or all of your money",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068440,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back? Number four, is the upside\nmeaningful and larger [music] than the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072720,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "downside? And number five, do you\nunderstand the risks? Meaning, can you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076120,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "clearly explain how the business works\nand what could [music] go wrong? Now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079720,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you understand the laws that decide\nwhether money compounds or disappears,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083520,
    "dDurationMs": 5102,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the next step is knowing how to apply\nthem in real decisions. Watch this next"
